p('Target ambiguity matters: frequency ties affect roughly 58-61% of users. Exact tie-averaged AP gives v4 0.393055 / 0.335472; a numerical-ID tie rule is a local convention. Candidate oracles and perfect reranking figures are upper bounds computed with holdout knowledge, not deployable predictions. The observed data provides no evidence that 0.8 is attainable or that the current solution is optimal.')
page('Kaggle evidence: final submission')
